      "full_actual_abstract_HTML": "<section id=\"original-abstract\" aria-labelledby=\"abstract-heading\">\n    <h2 id=\"abstract-heading\">Original manuscript abstract</h2>\n    <p>The rank completion printed in Ohtsuki's Conjecture 7.30 cannot interpolate the standard unified sl_n invariants of an integral homology sphere with nonzero Casson invariant. A finite quotient forces its first Taylor coefficients to be affine in n, contrary to the classical cubic coefficient formula. The specified Poincaré sphere gives the incompatible values 0,−6,−24. This is a negative answer to the literal displayed statement, obtained from established quantum-invariant results.</p>\n  </section>",
